            </note>
            <note corresp="#d770-f2" n="31" xml:id="d770-f2-content">
                <p>See telegrams no. 102, Feb. 19, and no. 107, Feb. 21, to the Ambassador in Great
                    Britain, <hi rendition="#italic">supra.</hi></p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
